The Debian Package stellar-archivist-rs
----------------------------

This package provides the Rust implementation of stellar-archivist, a toolset
for working with stellar-core history archives. The binary is installed as
/usr/bin/stellar-archivist-rs so it can coexist with the Go stellar-archivist
package.

 -- Package Maintainer <packages@stellar.org>  Mon, 30 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
